{
  "iri": "http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CHEBI_50275",
  "lang": "en",
  "description": [
    "A 5-methoxy-2-{[(4-methoxy-3,5-dimethylpyridin-2-yl)methyl]sulfinyl}-1<em>H</em>-benzimidazole that has <i>S</i> configuration at the sulfur atom. An inhibitor of gastric acid secretion, it is used (generally as its sodium or magnesium salt) for the treatment of gastro-oesophageal reflux disease, dyspepsia, peptic ulcer disease, and Zollinger-Ellison syndrome."
  ],
